{"availability":"available","full":"Parithosh-Varma/pool-anything","name":"pool-anything","description":"Pool free-tier API keys from any provider and rotate through them — round-robin key selection, per-key usage/quota tracking, and a drop-in HTTP proxy with a built-in web UI. TypeScript + SQLite, zero runtime dependencies.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":17,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T09:43:40Z","updated":"2026-10-14T13:38:24Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pool-anything.pages.dev","topics":["api-gateway","api-key-pool","api-proxy","free-tier","key-rotation","llm-gateway","openai-compatible","quota","rate-limit","round-robin","self-hosted","sqlite","typescript","usage-tracking","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://pool-anything-tools.pages.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:04.189Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:04.189Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:04.189Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:12.366Z","stars":15,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:35:13.888Z","stars":17,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.245Z","stars":17,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:58:04.189Z","stars":17,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Gather free-tier API keys into one pool. Rotate through them automatically.","🌐 Landing page · 🖥️ Live demo: tools UI · 📖 Docs","Most AI/API providers hand you a free tier: a rate limit, a daily quota, a handful of trial tokens. One key's worth is small — but several keys, rotated, adds up. pool-anything lets you gather N keys for the same provider into a pool, then serves them through a single endpoint that round-robins across them and tracks usage per key."],"features":["🔁 Round-robin rotation — every request draws the next key in the pool","📊 Usage & quota tracking — per-key and per-pool token counts in SQLite","🌐 Drop-in HTTP proxy — point your client at pool-anything; it forwards with the right key, header, and auth scheme","🔌 36 providers preconfigured — Groq, OpenRouter, Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, and more (plus any custom provider)","🖥️ Built-in web UI — search providers, gather keys, watch usage on the Analytics dashboard"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Parithosh-Varma/pool-anything/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ab9d5830d1eb1945e09bf682224c7daf1bbe8b94488d94320de963b8a4d46ceb","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:12.506Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.334Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Gather free-tier API keys into one pool. Rotate through them automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Parithosh-Varma/pool-anything/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ab9d5830d1eb1945e09bf682224c7daf1bbe8b94488d94320de963b8a4d46ceb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Parithosh-Varma/pool-anything/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.334Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T02:24:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Parithosh-Varma/pool-anything/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.335Z","hash":"ab9d5830d1eb1945e09bf682224c7daf1bbe8b94488d94320de963b8a4d46ceb","originalBytes":21156,"storedBytes":21156,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.245Z","subjects":["Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Self-hosted apps"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Self-hosted apps","source":"metadata","match":"self hosted"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Templates & UI components","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"qualityPriority":false,"demoHealth":{"url":"https://pool-anything-tools.pages.dev/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T18:36:14.268Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-14T18:36:14.268Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-14T18:36:14.268Z","tar